% the problem's x_1 ... (y_1 ...).
% P16b. m = n/4 = 25. Stage 1: four contributors, each a computation spawned by the harness (SPAWN C1 ... C4;
% harnesses/absys/README.md 3.6), contributor c giving succ(x_i, x_{i+1}) for i = (c-1)m+1, ..., cm, ascending, as one
