% unknown (QUESTIONS, A5). Stage 2 total = x_1 + x_{m+1} + x_{2m+1} + x_{3m+1} + x_{4m+1}, as written (compound: SPECIFICATION.md,
% Arithmetic). Stage 3 x_1 = <k>.
